@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F6FAFC
skinparam packageBorderColor #458F88
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam padding 10
top to bottom direction
title Resumefolio ecosystem — internal responsibilities and information relationships
package "Resumefolio product boundary — logical capabilities, not separate deployed services" {
 rectangle "Profile and tailored resumes\nIndependent content and explicit updates" as P
 rectangle "Portfolio and evidence\nSelected projects, skills and files" as E
 rectangle "PDF and protected sharing\nExplicit publication; controlled retrieval" as S
 rectangle "Application tracking\nOpportunities, progress, actual submitted copies" as A
 rectangle "Communication\nAccount-scoped mail and calendar activities" as C
 rectangle "Work management\nProjects, work items, tasks and Sprints" as W
 rectangle "Product Git hosting\nRepositories, revisions, PRs and reviews" as G
 rectangle "Workflow execution\nConditional, authorized exact-revision runs" as X #FFF3DF
 rectangle "Deployment\nSeparate target authorization and result" as D #FFF3DF
 rectangle "Shared administration and operations\nAccounts / permissions / file policy\nNotification delivery / quality / recovery" as O #E0F1EE
 P --> S : selected resume version\nseparate publication confirmation
 E --> S : selected evidence\nsubject to access policy
 P --> A : selected preparation reference
 S --> A : preserve actual sent material\nnot a live-content replacement
 A --> C : deliberate correspondence\nand activity association
 W --> G : deliberate work-to-revision links
 G --> X : exact revision + workflow context
 X --> D : eligible artifact / revision\nseparate deployment decision
 P -[hidden]-> E
 C -[hidden]-> W
 D -[hidden]-> O
}
note bottom of O
Shared authority, file lifecycle and operating rules apply to EVERY area.
No ownership or permission is inherited merely through a relationship.
end note
legend bottom
Arrows show selected information/reference directions, not automatic triggers or API calls.
All boxes describe target scope; amber execution/deployment remains capability-gated.
Profile edits do not automatically alter resumes, publication or previously sent copies.
External providers and operating facilities are mapped in the companion connections view.
endlegend
@enduml
